WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.538 --> 00:00:02.658
A breakup ends a relationship.

2
00:00:02.913 --> 00:00:04.933
Not every digital connection.

3
00:00:06.425 --> 00:00:07.670
Meet Untangle.

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.270
A private guide for your next chapter.

5
00:00:11.365 --> 00:00:13.050
Maya changed her password.

6
00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:15.674
But the shared laptop, and their photos?

7
00:00:15.911 --> 00:00:17.458
She still has questions.

8
00:00:18.431 --> 00:00:21.020
Her story becomes six relevant checks.

9
00:00:21.281 --> 00:00:23.905
The companion includes preparation, connects

10
00:00:23.905 --> 00:00:26.446
related guides, and shows what it used.

11
00:00:27.438 --> 00:00:30.933
Optional AI can select guides and clarify notes.

12
00:00:31.213 --> 00:00:34.250
This prepared example shows the controls: preview

13
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.695
the wording, keep your meaning, accept, or undo.

14
00:00:39.412 --> 00:00:42.075
Before changing anything, see what a password

15
00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.732
change affects, and what it leaves outside.

16
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.407
The explanation links to its source.

17
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.070
Keep the steps you choose.

18
00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:52.820
An unanswered question stays a question.

19
00:00:53.087 --> 00:00:55.620
Reading a guide never marks it reviewed.

20
00:00:57.425 --> 00:00:59.145
Save an encrypted file.

21
00:00:59.387 --> 00:01:03.000
Open it later, and your checks, notes, and questions

22
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:03.795
come back.

23
00:01:04.037 --> 00:01:05.695
No account to create.

24
00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.690
Less guesswork.

25
00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:10.533
A clearer next step.

26
00:01:10.787 --> 00:01:12.439
And the choice stays yours.

27
00:01:13.462 --> 00:01:14.345
Your life.

28
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:15.608
Your terms.

29
00:01:15.862 --> 00:01:16.820
Untangle.
